{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"d23eb8d19dba9dfe53a8389a033b7c88af2e2a85b06a74caea9a0e1ec41bedad":{"role":"assistant","text":"Let me start by understanding my current situation. I'm docked at Benchmark Home Station and need to complete a mine-and-sell loop. Let me first check my status and then follow the steps.\n\nLet me start by getting my status and understanding what I have.\n</think>\n\nI'll start the mine-and-sell loop right away. Let me first check my current status and cargo. | tool: game({\"command\":\"get_status\",\"args\":{}})"},"4e45575478410680f4383527d10321be7b1f84385b5c8cb102668e0e7860af4f":{"role":"toolResult","tool":"game","text":"bench_rookie [solarian] | 150cr | Bench Home\nShip: Theoria (theoria) | Hull: 100/100 | Shield: 55/55 (+1/tick) | Armor: 5 | Speed: 1\nFuel: 100/100 | Cargo: 0/70 | CPU: 4/16 | Power: 10/28\nDocked at: bench_home_station\nSecurity: Maximum Security (empire capital)\nConnections: bench_crossroads\nModules (2):\nid\ttype\tslot\tsize\twear\tstats\n52028d6519908563cf7de084fc52ac